  "reasoning": "The defendant operated a Chinese medicine department, purchased raw herbal materials and packaging, repackaged and labeled the herbal decoction pieces for sale without obtaining a drug production license. This constitutes illegal manufacturing (processing) and sale of drug products, which under Chinese criminal law is the crime of illegal production and sale of drugs. No other listed offenses apply.",
